  "formalScope": "Actual prime-error local integrability, right continuity and right FTC; exact adjacent primitive identity; terminal and L1 energy estimates; finite complex integration by parts; finite Mellin block identity for every complex parameter; test-function estimate with all derivative/integrability/domain hypotheses. No global growth bound or coarse-bound-to-RH implication.",
